// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`the messy design > formats the retry message the model receives 1`] = `
"Sketch could not build your design exactly as written. Return the COMPLETE corrected StudyDesign.
Fix only the problems listed. Keep every id, stage, prompt and attribute that is not mentioned exactly as it was, in the same order.
Ids are references: if you rename one, rename every reference to it. Do not invent attributes a stage does not need.

Design problems (paths refer to your design JSON):
- [DUPLICATE_TYPE_ID] relationships[0].id: Two node types / relationships use id "person"; the second became "person_2". Give each its own id.
- [CONSENT_FOLDED] egoAttributes[0]: Consent attribute "participant_consent" was replaced by the built-in consent question (includeConsent); the interview ends if the participant declines.
- [DUPLICATE_ATTRIBUTE_ID] egoAttributes[2]: Two different attributes use id "age"; the second became "age_2" and every reference to "age" points at the first. Give each attribute its own id.
- [TOO_FEW_OPTIONS] egoAttributes[4].options: ordered attribute "mood" needs at least 2 options; it was turned into free text.
- [BAD_SCORES] egoAttributes[5].optionScores: optionScores of "scale" must be one distinct whole number per option (3); they were dropped and options scored 1..n.
- [STAGE_BEFORE_NAMES] stages[2]: Stage "early" uses "person" nodes before any earlier nameGenerator creates them. The stage was removed.
- [CONDITION_BEFORE_COLLECTED] stages[3].skipLogic.conditions[0]: Skip condition tests "smokes" on egoAttributes, which no EARLIER stage collects.
- [EMPTY_SKIP] stages[3].skipLogic: mode skip_if has no usable conditions; the stage is always shown.
- [UNKNOWN_ATTRIBUTE] stages[3].attributeIds[2]: Form attribute "undefined_attr" is not an attribute of egoAttributes. Matching attributes there: age (number), age_2 (text), smokes (yes_no), mood (text), scale (ordered).
- [UNKNOWN_ATTRIBUTE] stages[3].attributeIds[3]: Form attribute "closeness" is not an attribute of egoAttributes. Matching attributes there: age (number), age_2 (text), smokes (yes_no), mood (text), scale (ordered).
- [EMPTY_PROMPT] stages[4].prompts[1]: Prompt without text removed.
- [BAD_CONDITION] stages[5].filter.conditions[0]: a yes_no value must be "yes" or "no" (got "maybe"). Condition removed.
- [WRONG_KIND] stages[5].prompts[0].attributeId: Bin attribute "close" on node type "person" is yes_no, but this needs ordered or single_choice or multi_choice. Matching attributes there: person_closeness (ordered).
- [NARRATIVE_WITHOUT_MAP] stages[6]: narrative "story" needs an EARLIER sociogram of node type "person" (it reuses that map's positions). Add one, or remove the narrative. The stage was removed.
- [UNKNOWN_TYPE] stages[7].prompts[0].relationshipId: relationship "knows" is not declared. Declared: person_2.
- [WRONG_KIND] stages[7].prompts[1].attributeId: Highlight "person_closeness" is ordered; highlights must be yes_no. Prompt removed.
- [UNKNOWN_TYPE] stages[8].relationshipId: relationship "person" is not declared. Declared: person_2.
- [UNKNOWN_TYPE] stages[8]: relationshipForm "edge_form" has no valid relationship. The stage was removed.
- [EMPTY_SKIP] stages[9].skipLogic: mode show_only_if has no usable conditions; the stage is always shown.

(10 smaller issues were corrected automatically; you do not need to address them.)"
`;
